OL,3,CBev Craig promises 'big reveal' in
OL,4,Cfirst day as new Greater Manchester
OL,5,Cmayor
OL,7,FThe new mayor of Greater Manchester,
OL,8,FBev Craig, has told ITV News that she
OL,9,Fwill make a "big reveal" on her first
OL,10,Fday in the job.
OL,12,FMs Craig starts her role today after
OL,13,Fwinning the election for Labour last
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FThe vote was triggered by the
OL,17,Fdeparture of her predecessor, Andy
OL,18,FBurnham, to parliament and then
OL,19,FDowning Street.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
