PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785734375
OL,3,CBev Craig promises 'big reveal' in
OL,4,Cfirst day as new Greater Manchester
OL,5,Cmayor
OL,7,FShe told ITV News: "The big reveal
OL,8,Fwill come on Monday.
OL,10,F"I'll be going in first thing. I'll be
OL,11,Fsitting down with the staff. I'll be
OL,12,Fsetting out my plan for what we're
OL,13,Fgoing to achieve.
OL,15,F"And hopefully people will see that,
OL,16,Fin week one, I reach the end of that
OL,17,Fweek with some clear announcements of
OL,18,Fwhen - not if - I'm going to do some
OL,19,Fof the things I said I would."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
