FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785734375
OL,3,CBev Craig promises 'big reveal' in
OL,4,Cfirst day as new Greater Manchester
OL,5,Cmayor
OL,7,FAt a victory rally, on Saturday, Ms
OL,8,FCraig said people have been "crying
OL,9,Fout" for a commitment from "people in
OL,10,Fpower that get it".
OL,12,F"(People) that want to put more money
OL,13,Fin their pockets. That want to make
OL,14,Flife easier, that are on their side,
OL,15,Fand I'm excited to get stuck in," she
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FShe added: "I'll also say one final
OL,19,Fthing, and that's about what people
OL,20,Fhave voted for in this election.
OL,26,@pD@]OUqD@DO]qD@\OUrD@RO]tD@AOUwD@aO]zD@
OL,26,ALOU
