FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785734375
OL,3,CBev Craig promises 'big reveal' in
OL,4,Cfirst day as new Greater Manchester
OL,5,Cmayor
OL,7,F"They voted for Greater Manchester to
OL,8,Fbuild on the legacy that we've created
OL,9,Ftogether, but they voted to reject the
OL,10,Fdivision and the dividing lines that
OL,11,Fpeople put in our communities."
OL,13,FMs Craig won 47.15% of votes in the
OL,14,Ffirst round of the vote count.
OL,16,FHer tally was just short of the 50%
OL,17,Fneeded to win outright in the
OL,18,FSupplementary Vote (SV) system,
OL,19,Ftriggering a second round against the
OL,20,FReform UK candidate Sian Astley, on
OL,21,F20.99%.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@_O]
