OL,3,CBev Craig promises 'big reveal' in
OL,4,Cfirst day as new Greater Manchester
OL,5,Cmayor
OL,7,FLabour gained 58,076 more votes when
OL,8,Fthe second preferences of the five
OL,9,Feliminated candidates were
OL,10,Fdistributed, with Reform UK getting
OL,11,F45,250, leaving Ms Craig on 309,525
OL,12,Fvotes and Ms Astley on 157,178.
OL,14,FMore than two million people were
OL,15,Feligible to vote in the contest, but
OL,16,Fthe turnout was just over 25%.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
